{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理由にしてはいけないかもしれませんが\n稽古とライブリハーサルで\n頭と体がいっぱいいっぱいで\nバタバタしてブログ疎かにしてしまい\nすみません(T-T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2013/10/04/4272164/0001.png","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく、若月............"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログも必ずちゃんとかくから\n待っててね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待たせてばっかで\n本当に本当にごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2013/10/04/4272164/0000.png","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}